[I] Displays all the characters in an X font

[T] The xfd utility creates a window containing the name of the font being
[T] displayed, a row of command buttons, several lines of text for displaying
[T] character metrics, and a grid containing one glyph per cell.

[U] https://www.X.org

[A] X.org Foundation {http://www.X.org}
